{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block title %}Privacy Policy{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="page-wrapper">
  {% include "partials/topbar.njk" %}
  {% set title = "Privacy Policy" %}
  {% include "partials/page-title.njk" %}
  {% include "partials/permanents.njk" %}

  <section class="feature-section page-wrapper-two ptb-120">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
          <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 13, 2026</p>
          <p>This Privacy Policy describes how Freeny Enterprise LLC (“Freeny Enterprise,” “we,” “us,” or “our”)
            collects, uses, and shares information in connection with our website, vehicle rental services, and
            booking-related communications.</p>

          <h2>Information we collect</h2>
          <p>Depending on how you interact with us, information may include:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Contact information, such as your name, email address, phone number, and messages you send us.</li>
            <li>Reservation and rental information, such as requested dates, vehicle details, rental history, and
              information needed to administer a rental.</li>
            <li>Information needed for rental eligibility and administration, such as identification, driver’s
              license, insurance, and payment-related information.</li>
            <li>Mobile number and consent or opt-out status if you choose to receive booking-related text messages.</li>
            <li>Technical or usage information that may be collected by our website hosting, booking, or other
              service providers when you use their services.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>How we use information</h2>
          <p>We use information to respond to inquiries, manage reservations and rentals, communicate about bookings,
            process payments, provide customer support, protect our business and customers, meet legal obligations,
            and maintain or improve our services.</p>

          <h2>Booking and other service providers</h2>
          <p>Our online reservation feature is provided through a third-party booking platform. When you use that
            feature, information you submit may be collected and processed by the booking platform and its providers
            under their own privacy terms. We may also use service providers for website hosting, communications,
            payment processing, customer support, and business operations. These providers may access information
            when needed to perform services for us.</p>
          <p>We may also disclose information when reasonably necessary to comply with law, respond to valid legal
            process, protect rights and safety, or address fraud or security issues. We do not sell your mobile
            number or SMS consent, and we do not share that information with third parties or affiliates for their
            marketing or promotional purposes. Service providers supporting our messaging program may use it only
            to provide those services.</p>

          <h2>Text messages</h2>
          <p>If you opt in, we use your mobile number to send booking-related text messages and manage your messaging
            preferences. Message frequency varies, and message and data rates may apply. Reply <strong>STOP</strong>
            to opt out or <strong>HELP</strong> for help. See our <a href="sms-terms.html">SMS Terms</a> for details.
            We do not share SMS opt-in information or consent with third parties or affiliates for their marketing
            or promotional purposes.</p>

          <h2>Cookies and third-party links</h2>
          <p>Some website features, embedded content, or third-party services may use cookies or similar technologies
            and may collect information under their own privacy practices. You can manage cookies through your
            browser settings. We do not control the privacy practices of third-party websites or services; please
            review their privacy notices when you use them.</p>

          <h2>Retention and security</h2>
          <p>We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this policy,
            including providing services, maintaining business records, resolving disputes, and meeting legal
            obligations. We use reasonable measures intended to protect information, but no method of transmission
            or storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>

          <h2>Your choices and contact information</h2>
          <p>You may contact us to ask about or update information you have provided, subject to applicable law and
            our need to keep certain records. You can opt out of booking-related text messages at any time by replying
            <strong>STOP</strong>. For privacy questions or requests, contact Freeny Enterprise LLC at
            <a href="tel:7035991585">703-599-1585</a> or
            <a href="mailto:contact@FreenyEnterpriseLLC.com">contact@FreenyEnterpriseLLC.com</a>.</p>

          <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the revised policy on this page and
            update the “Last updated” date above.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
</div>
{% endblock %}
